DTSTAMP:20260819T002318Z
SUMMARY:BINGO WITH CATS
LOCATION:The Cat Lady Cafe | 401 E Colfax Ave | South Bend\, 46617
DESCRIPTION:Bingo with cats! Just like you’d expect - one hour in our cat
  lounge\, hanging with adoptable cats while playing several rounds of bin
 go. Prizes include cat lounge passes\, bags of coffee from Bendix Roaster
 s and cat-themed merchandise. Drinks available for purchase\, including b
 eer and wine!\n\nMore Info: https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/bingo-w
 ith-cats-4/
URL:https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/bingo-with-cats-4/
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260821T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260821T183000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
