DTSTAMP:20260819T002318Z
SUMMARY:END OF SUMMER CELEBRATION
LOCATION:Kamm Island | 100 N Center St | Mishawaka\, 46544
DESCRIPTION:Join us for our big bash at the last Summer Concert Series perf
 ormance with Paul Erdman! Inflatables ( $5 per child\, wristband required
 )\, food trucks\, all our market vendors from the whole summer and the la
 st bits of summer fun! Free to attend\, except inflatables!\n\nMore Info:
  https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/end-of-summer-celebration/
URL:https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/end-of-summer-celebration/
