STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:d256e4ee61a79e08235478c1@visitsouthbend.com
DTSTAMP:20260819T002318Z
SUMMARY:FAITHFUL 5K
LOCATION:Downtown Mishawaka Riverwalk and Battell Park Bandshell | 301 W. M
 ishawaka Ave.\, Mishawaka\, IN 46545 | Mishawaka\, IN 46545
DESCRIPTION:Join us on August 22\, 2026 at 8:00am for a professionally time
 d 3.1 mile run along Mishawaka’s Riverwalk\, beginning at the Battell P
 ark Bandshell.\n\nPrefer a family-friendly walk? Sign-up for the 1-mile r
 oute\, beginning at 9am. What a fun way to connect with people in our com
 munity! You can enjoy faith and fellowship as we kick-off our St. Monica 
 Parish Festivities.\n\nMore Info: https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/f
 aithful-5k/
URL:https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/faithful-5k/
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260822T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260822T110000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:c8f6f091d0d1ae15b85b56f7@visitsouthbend.com
DTSTAMP:20260819T002318Z
SUMMARY:FILM—"BACKROOMS: EVERYTHING MUST GO EDITION" (2026)
LOCATION:DeBartolo Performing Arts Center
DESCRIPTION:New at the Browning Directed by Kane Parsons With Chiwetel Ejio
 for\, Renate Reinsve\, Mark Duplass Rated R\, 126 minutes In English\, Po
 rtuguese\, Turkish\, Arabic\, and Japanese with English subtitles A stran
 ge doorway appears in the basement of a furniture showroom potentially le
 ading to the next generation of Hollywood filmmaking. A summer sensation 
 that many believe finally heralds the gluing of DIY filmmakers to the stu
 dio system\, this version of Backrooms adds 16 minutes to the cut that br
 ought millions out to see what lurks inside the corpse of brick and morta
 r capitalism. GET TICKETS\n\nMore Info: https://www.visitsouthbend.com/ev
 ents/film-backrooms-everything-must-go-edition-2026/
URL:https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/film-backrooms-everything-must-go
 -edition-2026/
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260820T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260820T211000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:19cf54f18ed9acdb7ef3b36d@visitsouthbend.com
DTSTAMP:20260819T002318Z
SUMMARY:FRIDAYS BY THE FOUNTAIN
LOCATION:Morris Performing Arts Center | 211 N Michigan St | South Bend\, I
 N 46601
DESCRIPTION:This year Fridays by the Fountain will return to Jon R. Hunt Pl
 aza at the Morris!\nWe will have food trucks\, live music\, and free comm
 unity fun!\nHeld on Fridays between 11:45 a.m. and 1:15 p.m.\, each conce
 rt is free of charge. Now in its 26th year\, Fridays by the Fountain show
 cases live entertainment from area blues\, jazz\, rock\, R&B\, pop\, folk
 \, and Irish music bands.\n\nThis year’s lineup includes:\nJune 5 – R
 ockDogs\nJune 12 – Q sonics\nJune 19 – Southside Denny\nJune 26 – H
 ey Annie\nJuly 3 – Memphis Underground\nJuly 10 – Don Savoie\nJuly 17
  – Resurrection Blues Band\nJuly 24 – Big Daddy Dupree’s Broke & Hu
 ngry Blues Band\nJuly 31 – Van Dyke Revue\nAugust 7 – PT and The Crui
 sers\nAugust 14 – David Hilliker Trio\nAugust 21 – High Life\nAugust 
 28 – Kennedy’s Kitchen\n\nMore Info: https://www.visitsouthbend.com/e
 vents/fridays-by-the-fountain/
URL:https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/fridays-by-the-fountain/
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260821T114500
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260821T131500
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
