BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:b55b03a18c15b0e5f7825518@visitsouthbend.com
DTSTAMP:20260819T002318Z
SUMMARY:SCAVENGER HUNT AT THE MORRIS
LOCATION:The Morris Performing Arts Center | 211 N Michigan St | South Bend
 \, IN 46601
DESCRIPTION:Experience the Morris Performing Arts Center like never before!
  Join Connect 574 for an interactive scavenger hunt that takes you behind
  the scenes and throughout the venue as you solve clues and discover fasc
 inating facts about the historic building.\n\nWhether you’re a first-ti
 me visitor or a longtime patron\, this adventure is a great way to connec
 t with others and learn more about a defining South Bend landmark. Gather
  your own team or have us create one for you\, put your detective skills 
 to the test\, and see if you can complete the hunt before time runs out!\
 n\nWhere: Morris Performing Arts Center\n\nWhen: August 21 at 6:30\n\nEve
 nt Highlights:\n\nNo awkward intros: we’ll introduce you to your team a
 nd help break the ice – or if you’d like to sign up with friends\, th
 at’s okay too!\n\nGet to know a South Bend landmark: The Morris has bee
 n part of our skyline for over 100 years\, and has a lot of fascinating h
 istory inside.\n\nWelcome hour: We’ll have a cash bar for you to get co
 mfortable when you come in!\n\nMore Info: https://www.visitsouthbend.com/
 events/scavenger-hunt-at-the-morris/
URL:https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/scavenger-hunt-at-the-morris/
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260821T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260821T203000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
