DTSTAMP:20260819T002318Z
SUMMARY:SOUTH BEND CUBS VS. WEST MICHIGAN WHITECAPS
LOCATION:Four Winds Field | 501 W South St | South Bend\, IN 46601
DESCRIPTION:Ticket Offer:\n\nPro Wrestling Night II\n\nIt is official! WWE 
 RAW General Manager and longtime professional wrestling standout "Scrap I
 ron" Adam Pearce is coming to Four Winds Field on Thursday\, August 20 fo
 r Pro Wrestling Night II. Adding to the excitement\, Revolution Champions
 hip Wrestling returns with action-packed matches both before and after th
 e game. Fans who purchase the Pro Wrestling Night ticket package will rec
 eive early entry to the ballpark to catch all the pregame wrestling actio
 n. During the game\, enjoy an exclusive Meet & Greet with Adam Pearce on 
 the United Federal Credit Union Rooftop while indulging in an all-you-can
 -eat ballpark buffet. The night wraps up with two bonus wrestling matches
  following the game.\n\nGame Highlights:\n\n\nThirsty Thursday\n\nEnjoy $
 3 fountain sodas (24 oz.) and domestic draft beer (16 oz.) all game long.
 \n\nMore Info: https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/south-bend-cubs-vs-w
 est-michigan-whitecaps2/
URL:https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/south-bend-cubs-vs-west-michigan-
 whitecaps2/
