BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:b2187ffe9a9741bcbe07f172@visitsouthbend.com
DTSTAMP:20260819T002318Z
SUMMARY:THE ART OF CIGAR ROLLING: A MASTERCLASS EXPERIENCE
LOCATION:Jackson's Cigars & Spirits | 100 N Center St #40 | Mishawaka\, IN 
 46544
DESCRIPTION:Experience the Art of Cigar Rolling at Jackson’s Cigars & Spi
 rits\n\nEver wondered what it takes to turn a tobacco leaf into a premium
 \, hand-rolled cigar? On August 20\, Jackson’s Cigars & Spirits in Mish
 awaka is bringing the craft to life with a special evening featuring a La
  Galera cigar representative and live cigar rolling demonstration.\n\nEve
 nt Features\n\nLive La Galera cigar rolling demonstration\n\nFresh hand-r
 olled cigars\n\nLa Galera cigar specials\n\nCrafted cigar-pairing cocktai
 ls\n\nEnter to win a La Galera Year of the Horse Limited Edition Gift Set
 \n\nBuy 4 cigars and receive the raffle entry\n\nWatch the process firsth
 and as tobacco leaves are selected\, prepared and expertly rolled into fi
 nished cigars. Guests will have the opportunity to experience a fresh han
 d-rolled cigar while learning more about the craftsmanship and tradition 
 behind La Galera cigars.\n\nThroughout the evening\, enjoy La Galera ciga
 r specials\, handcrafted cocktails designed to pair with your cigar\, and
  raffle giveaways. Purchase four cigars and get one free\, and enter for 
 a chance to win the La Galera Year of the Horse Limited Edition Box.\n\nW
 hether you’re a longtime cigar enthusiast or simply curious about how a
  cigar is made\, this is a rare opportunity to see the craft up close in 
 the relaxed\, upscale atmosphere of Jackson’s Cigars & Spirits.\n\nThur
 sday\, August 20\n\nDoors open at 4:00 PM | Cigar rolling begins at 5:00 
 PM\n\nJackson’s Cigars & Spirits | Mishawaka\, Indiana\n\nFree admissio
 n | Ages 21+\n\nMore Info: https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/the-art-
 of-cigar-rolling-a-masterclass-experience/
URL:https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/the-art-of-cigar-rolling-a-master
 class-experience/
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260820T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260820T200000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
